WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Forward heavy connects before Level 2.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.200
Juri activates held Feng Shui Engine.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.000
Crouching light kick starts the low chain after activation.

4
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Standing medium punch and light kick continue the FSE chain.

5
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.200
Forward medium leads through crouching medium kick into crouching heavy.

6
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:06.700
Standing heavy kick continues the airborne juggle.

7
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.950
Heavy Fuhajin ends the route with the recorded +42 knockdown.
